    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shikombe ng'wigūnīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūng'wīla ū ntūmami wa ha ng'wakwe gīkī, “A magūnīla ga banhū benabo gookajage shilīwa hangī, gīt'umo būlī ng'wene adūgije kūbūūcha; nī hela jabo ūbatūūlīle, būlī ng'wene ū ng'wigūnīla lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī shikombe shane ī sha feza ūshitūūle ū ng'wigūnīla lya nzuna wabo ū wa kūmalīīja, shibize ng'wenūmo nī hela jakwe ī ja shilīwa.” Ng'hana wīta gīt'umo akawīlīlwa nū Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho weela ū būjikū, a banhū benabo būshindīkīlwa ītaalī dilū, bandya lūgendo nī nzobe jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bataalī kūgūsegenela ū nzengo, ū Yosefu ūng'wīla ū ntūmami wakwe gīkī, “Bakūūbījage wangū a banhū benabo, ūlū ūlabapandīke ūbawīle gīkī, ‘Nibūlī ū wiza ng'wabūlīpa yabūbi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikombe shenīshi shitī sha ng'wa baba būgonzo sha kūng'welà na kūlagūlīla? Ū mhayo ūyo ng'wagwītaga gwenūyū mi no!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabapandīka ūbawīla ng'hana ī mihayo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būshosha balīhaya, “Mhayo kī gwenheleja nose ū nkūjiwa ū sīswe būgonzo ahaye mihayo īlī gīko? A abise basese bako tūlingilo ūskwīta mhayo gūlī gīko; gūkachīīlage kūle ūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū beebe manīlaga dūhū a ha gīkī ī hela ījo tūkajisangīla mu magūnīla gise twajenhanīgije kūfuma Kanaani. Nibūlī hangī tūgime kwiba feza nūūlū zahabu kūfuma mu numba ya ng'wa so būgonzo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū alilonge ūmò wa mu bise batūmami bako alī nasho akūcha; hama pye a bangī tūkūbiza basese ba ng'wa sīswe būgonzo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nag'hwe ūshosha, “Ū gwenūyo ng'wadala, na lūūlū twītwe gīkī, ūyo alilongeali nasho h'ūyo akūbiza nsese wane; a bangī pye mukūbiza mutī mu kwihīga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo būlī ng'wene wicha ha sī ū nigo gwakwe ūgūtaligūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntūmami ng'wenūyo wandya kūbaloja ī miligo yabo, kwandīja ū ntaale wabo ūkamalīīgīja kūlī ndo wabo. Ī shikombe shilongela ng'wigūnīla lya ng'wa Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo būtandūla shizwalo shabo kūlwa būpīna; ī miligo yabo bīdaamhīja ha nzobe jabo haho na haho, būshoka ū mu nzengo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yuda kwiyanda kūlī Yosefu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washoka ū Yuda na a baana ba ng'wawe, būnsanga ū Yosefu ataalī mo ū mu numba; būshikīla kwiponeja ha sī ū kū būtongi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūbawīla, “Mhayo kī ū gwenūyū ng'wītaga? Mutamanile gīkī ū munhū wa kūbiza gītī nene adūgije kūmanīja mihayo nūūlū ya mu mbisīla?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yuda ūhaya, “Tūlī na mhayo kī ūyo tūdūgije kūng'wīla ū sīswe būgonzo? Tūyombe mhayo kī? Gūlīho mhayo kī ūyo gūdūgije kūtūgunanha mu kwibūūla kwise? Ū Mulungu waboolechaga hape ū būkenaagūji wa basese bako. Ī haha pye tūlī basese ba ng'wa sīswe nkūjiwa; a bise aba, nū yūyo wabonagwa nasho ī shikombe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yosefu ūhaya, “Ū nene ngilo ū kwīta mhayo gūlī gīko. Ūyo wabonagwa nasho ī shikombe, ng'wenūyo dūhū h'ūyo akūbiza nsese wane. A bangī pye shimīzagi mhola muje kūlī sīng'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yuda ūng'wegeela ūng'wīla, “Baba nkūjiwa, nkūlīlagwe ū nsese wako ayombe kamhayo kaka ū kūlī baba nkūjiwa. Ūtizūmpelanīla ū nsese wako, nūūlū īkī ūlī na būdūla gītī Falao ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe baba nkūjiwa ūkatūbūja a bise basese bako gīkī, ‘Mulī na sīng'we nūūlū nzuna wing'we?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūkakūshokeja gīkī, ‘Ū sīswe tūlīnang'hwe, gwike wakūlaga; hama alīho na nsūmba, ng'witūnja wakwe akabyalwa kū būnamhala wakwe. Ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo walī na nkūlūye, ūzumalīka; ūsaaga wei iyene dūhū ū mu bitūnja ba kūbyalwa nū nina. Na lūūlū ū ise antogilwe no!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe aho wigwa gīko ūkayomba, ‘Ng'wenhagi nize namone nane na miso gane.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūkakūnshokeja ū bebe baba nkūjiwa gīkī, ‘Ū nyanda atūdūla ū kwīnga aneke ū ise, ūlū wīta gīko akūzumalīka ū namhala!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū bebe ūkatūwīla a bise basese bako gīkī, ‘Ū nzuna wing'we wa kūmalīīja ūlū atizile hamò ning'we, mutī bakūbūbona hangī ū būshū wane.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū aho twashoka ū kūlī ntūmami wako ū sīswe, tūkang'wīla īyo ūkīhaya ū bebe baba nkūjiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo lyashikile ikanza ū sīswe ūtūwīla, ‘Jagi ko hangī mukatūsumīle ī shilīwa nūūlū shigehu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nise tūshosha, ‘Tūtūjaga ko. Ū kūja ū kwenūko numho ū nzuna wise abize alī hamò nise. Ū nzuna wise ūlū atī hamò nise, tūtīko ū kūbūbona ū būshū wa munhū ng'wenūyo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsese wako ū sīswe ūtūwīla gīkī, ‘Ū nke wane akanibyalīla bitūnja babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò ūnileka ūkajimīīla; nane nūhaya, Ū ng'wenūyo walyiwe mashiinū, na kūshisha lelo īyī natīnamona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munīngīje nū ng'wenūyū, hūna mhayo gose gose gwabūbi gūkang'wilongele koi, mukūnibūlaga na būpīna, mubize ng'wanihilimīkīja mu shigila gete!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūlū nūja ū kūlī nsese wako ū sīswe alīyo ū nyanda atī hamò nise, ū sīswe ūyo būpanga bokwe būlī hamò nū būpanga bo nyanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akūyagala ūlū ūbona gīkī ū nyanda atīho. A bise basese bako tūkūmūlaga na būpīna ū sīswe, tūng'hilimīkīje mu shigila gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nsese wako hū nakiyeega ū kūlī baba kūlwa nguno yakwe ū nyanda. Nakahaya gīkī, ‘Ūlū nūlemeelwa kūng'wenha kūlī bebe hangī, ū nene hū nakūbūbūūcha ū būbi wenūbo ū kū būtongi wako baba, shikū jose ja būlamu bone!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, nalīkwikūmbīlīja ū nene nsese wako nashiige aha, a ha ng'wanya gwa nyanda, nabize nene ū nsese wa ng'wa baba nkūjiwa; ū nyanda ashoke kaya na a bakūlūye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūdūla ginehe ū nene ū kūja ū kūlī baba, ū nyanda ūlū atī hamò nane? Yaya natūdūla! Natatogilwe kūgūbona ū mhayo gwabūbi gwenūyo gūlīngwīla ū baba!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
